        "name": "Pristina centre, Newborn monument and National Library",
        "description": "The compact capital, with a yellow Newborn sign, Mother Teresa Boulevard and a famous brutalist library.",
        "details": "Pristina has a walkable centre. The Newborn monument is repainted each independence anniversary, and the National Library is an unusual concrete building covered in metal lattice. The Ethnographic Museum and the Skanderbeg statue are close. Evenings are lively on the pedestrian street.",
