      "kosovo/rugova-gorge": {
        "name": "Rugova Gorge and Via Ferrata",
        "description": "A deep canyon in the Accursed Mountains with hiking, a zip line and a cliffside via ferrata.",
        "details": "The Rugova Canyon begins just outside Peja and has hiking trails, climbing and Kosovo longest zip line. The via ferrata climbs the canyon wall with cables and ladders. The weather is cooler than the plains, and a taxi to the canyon is cheap.",
